  message: "Fixed in PR #2112: a set value is kept only if huggingface_hub reads it as offline; anything else becomes 1. Re-ran the filed repro after the fix: default sketch with HF_HUB_OFFLINE=0 -> 0 connects, =false -> 0, --config-extraction embedding with =0 -> 0; 5 cached model files opened in each, so the embeddings path ran. A fresh-interpreter test started with HF_HUB_OFFLINE=0 asserts huggingface_hub.constants.HF_HUB_OFFLINE is True."  # 6a56
